    "notes": "Product-neutral regression for inline SVG loss inside a preserved layout container. Distilled from a footer icon row whose flex wrapper survived while its SVG children were dropped because empty-text anchors returned null before SvgElementConverter ran."
  },
  "legacy_comparison": {
    "skip": true,
